%description:
Tests TcpSocket::setSynRetries(), the Linux socket option TCP_SYNCNT. The
first connection of the client has one SYN retry, and its second connection
has the synRetries parameter of the module (12). The tester removes the first
two SYNs of each connection: the first connection fails at its second timeout
(t=3), and the second connection opens with its third SYN at t=3.5.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_tcp.initialRto = 1s
*.cli_app.socketSynRetries = 1
*.cli_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.cli_app.active2=true
*.cli_app.localPort2=1001
*.tcptester.script="a1 delete; a2 delete; a3 delete; a4 delete"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.001 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# deleting
cli_tcp: INIT --> SYN_SENT  (on OPEN_ACTIVE)
[0.501 A002] A.1001 > B.2000: S 125000:125000(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# deleting
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# deleting
[1.501 A004] A.1001 > B.2000: S 125000:125000(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# deleting
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> CLOSED  (on ABORT)
[3.501 A005] A.1001 > B.2000: S 125000:125000(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[3.503 B001] A.1001 < B.2000: A S 875500:875500(0) ack 125001 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[3.505 A006] A.1001 > B.2000: A ack 875501 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Retransmission count during connection setup exceeds 1, giving up
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
